    {
      "id": "kimetsu_no_yaiba_collab_event_2026-03-13",
      "nombre": "Kimetsu no Yaiba Collab Event",
      "caracteristicas": [
        "A collaboration event between Nyanko Daisensou and the popular shonen anime known as Demon Slayer (\u9b3c\u6ec5\u306e\u5203, Kimetsu no Yaiba, Demon Slayer) was originally held from January 30th, 2026 to February 16th, 2026. The collaboration includes an exclusive Rare Gacha, stages, Catnip Challenges and stamps going on during collaboration period. The anime is published by Shueisha. "
      ],
      "fecha_inicio": "2026-03-13",
      "fecha_fin": "2026-03-30"
    },
    {
      "id": "divine_archangel_strikes_2026-03-09",
      "nombre": "Divine Archangel Strikes",
      "caracteristicas": [
        "Divine Archangel Strikes contains a total of 20 No Continues levels, each called Blessing. After beating a level, the player must wait for 30 minutes before they may proceed to the next one. Rewards for the first completion of a level can include XP, Tickets, Catamins and Materials. Every 10 levels plays out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP are increased with each level."
      ],
      "fecha_inicio": "2026-03-09",
      "fecha_fin": "2026-03-16"
    },
    {
      "id": "legend_quest_2026-03-16",
      "nombre": "Legend Quest",
      "caracteristicas": [
        "Legend Quest is a map somewhat similar to Heavenly Tower, with 48 stages known as LEVELs. Each LEVEL is a random Stories of Legend stage that provides a partially randomized lineup. All LEVELs are No Continues, and exiting a battle within 10 seconds will not refund items, Crowns or energy."
      ],
      "fecha_inicio": "2026-03-16",
      "fecha_fin": "2026-03-30"
    },
    {
      "id": "arena_of_honor_2026-03-16",
      "nombre": "Arena of Honor",
      "caracteristicas": [
        "Ranking Dojo (\u30cd\u30b3\u9053\u5834\u30e9\u30f3\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8, Neko D\u014dj\u014d Rankingu Ibento, Cat Dojo Ranking Event) is an event that first appeared from July 31st to August 7th, 2017. This event was officially added in the Version 6.3 Update. The Ranking Dojo is accessed from the Catclaw Dojo menu, so the player needs to unlock the Catclaw Dojo feature in order to participate by completing Chapter 1 of Empire of Cats."
      ],
      "fecha_inicio": "2026-03-16",
      "fecha_fin": "2026-04-02"
